THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Files under `firmware/vendor/` are third-party board-support code, redistributed
under their own licences with copyright headers intact. See
`firmware/vendor/PROVENANCE.md` for the per-file record. In summary:

  * Board bring-up drivers (Display_ST77916, Touch_CST816, I2C_Driver,
    LvglPort, AudioFeedback, lv_conf) originate from
    `imliubo/codex-micro-4-core2` and its `Codex-Macro32` port — MIT,
    Copyright (c) 2026 imliubo.

  * `esp_lcd_st77916.*` and `es8311*` are Espressif/Waveshare sample drivers —
    Apache License 2.0.

The upstream `Codex-Macro32` repository additionally carries a limited-source-use
notice covering its own product UI and companion applications. None of that
material is used here; this project reuses only the permissively licensed driver
layer, as that notice expressly permits:

  > 不能把本说明解释为撤销、替代或限制第三方 MIT、Apache-2.0 或其他许可证
  > 已经授予的权利。

The browser flasher in `docs/` loads `esptool-js` (Apache-2.0, Espressif) from a
CDN at runtime; it is not redistributed in this repository.